<noscript><div id="user-comments"><h2 class="heading-size-2">评论</h2><div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>This mount is not rare, but nobody ever takes the time to buy the mount in a different zone than their license hehe.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>well , you need to be lvl 40 to get horse riding lesson so no , not lvl 17s can ride on it</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>U can train it in eastvale logging camp in Elwyn forset i think.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>Train at Eastvale logging camp, Elwyyn Forest. <br />Buy from breeder at Menethil, Wetlands.<br /><br />You need to be level 40 to ride any mount you cannot ride the black stallion at level 17.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>Is it possible to get a white horse at level 40? I saw a White Stallion running around the stable in Menethil, but it wasn't for sale. I looked all over the place (Elwynn, Theramore, Southshore) and couldn't find one to buy.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>There are <b>no white horse</b> available at lvl 40. <br /><br />The only white horse in the game is <b>the epic swift, white lvl 60 horse</b> (with armor.) <br /><br />The white horse at Theramore, Goldshire and other places is the <b>old epic horse</b> wich is <b>no longer available</b>. Sad, but true, they replaced it with a armor-covered uglylooking horse&nbsp; :|<br /><br />The black stallion is a <b>lvl 40 mount</b>. There are <b>one other black horse</b> in the game, and thats the epic <b>black war horse</b>&nbsp; (pvp mount)</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>Look...To get this mount head to wetlands-menethil harbor. The vendor is there. But to ride this mount you should head to eastvale loggin camp at elwyn forest and train to do so. So no u don't auto learn to ride it by buying it! to the question askin if dwarves can ride horses here is what i say: man if u are near lvl 40 and u have the guts to get exalted with stormwind then gg and go buy the horse. Eitherwise you can buy it but u can't train the horse riding. That is the same for every race.e.x. if human wants to ride a tiger he needs to be exalted with darnassus. getting exalted with cities is a doable thing with the repeatable runecloth donation.But last time i logged in runecloths aren't dropped at lvl40 places...=P so at lvl 40 try to get ur own race's mount. Leave the mixin up for lvl 60!</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>Can anyone tell me how i can get this or any kind of mount other than the dwarf ram considering im a dwarf? Rather i mean how can i train in horse riding or anything other than ram riding?<br /><br />Edit: if this is possible at all</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>All you need to do is be exalted with SW to get this mount if ur not a human.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>I've heard you get a discount on this item (and the riding ability) if you are exalted with SW, is this so?<br /><br />Also does the price differ if you are an exalted human compared to, say, an exalted dwarf?<br /><br />Thanks ahead for your time.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Thottbot</b></h3>hahahaha I'm a level 31 and I just bought it! granted I still need to hit 40 and get training, but I'm SOOOOOOOO excited!</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Allakhazam</b></h3>Just got it last night on my level 42 Druid! Only because female night elves look odd sitting on a sabercat...</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Allakhazam</b></h3>go to menethil harbor to get this horse.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Allakhazam</b></h3>yay i bought one for my lvl 36 draenei female! i had to really do alot of quests without getting any exp, only rep. but it's worth it, i can't wait til she hits 40! i did most of the human beginner quests, they reward alot of rep.</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Allakhazam</b></h3>Just bought this today! Hit Exalted this morning, only turned in 1 lost supply quest to check the hit, only got 25...<br /><br />You wont see to many level 40 Night Elves on this :D<br /><br />Well...not till later lol<br /><br />Bought the other 3 just for fun! and jsut in case they decide to reset the faction gain or something lol</div>

