<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Allakhazam</b></h3>Yeah the harbour is best, ull be there forever with katie, thats how i got mine!</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Allakhazam</b></h3>Menethil Harbour has an unlimited supply at thier vendor. No camping required!</div>

<div class="user-post-"><h3 class="heading-size-3">评论来自 <b>Sammyx3</b></h3>This Horse can be bought from <a href="/forever/cn/npc=1460/安格尔-斯塔特弗斯">安格尔·斯塔特弗斯</a> in Menethil in <a href="/forever/cn/zone=11/湿地">湿地</a>. Coordinates are <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/maps?data=11:086545">8.6, 54.5</a><br /><br />He sells the following Horses:<br /><a href="/forever/cn/item=2411/黑马缰绳">黑马缰绳</a><br /><a href="/forever/cn/item=2414/杂色马缰绳">杂色马缰绳</a><br /><a href="/forever/cn/item=5655/栗色马缰绳">栗色马缰绳</a><br /><a href="/forever/cn/item=5656/棕马缰绳">棕马缰绳</a><br /><br />If you want to know where you can get all the other Mounts in Classic from, <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide=8296/classic-all-available-mounts-and-how-to-obtain-them-guide">check out my guide here!</a></div>

